{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38871","headline":"怀庐岳旧隐 · 杜荀鹤","name":"怀庐岳旧隐","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一别三年长在梦，梦中时蹑石棱层。\n泉声入夜方堪听，山色逢秋始好登。\n岩鹿惯随锄药叟，溪鸥不怕洗苔僧。\n人间有许多般事，求要身闲直未能。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}